  "body": "Release 0.12.1 (patch: fixes only).\n\n- Merged in this cut: #78 (fix #67, cross-drill spindle), #86 (fix #77, P0 cross-drill raw-stock collision; replaces #82, auto-closed when its stacked base merged), #83 (fix #79, radial rapid-in-stock check), #76 (fix #74 part, GPU adapter selection - #74 stays open for the reporter's log).\n- This branch: RELEASE_NOTES.md, CHANGELOG.md rows (one per merged PR, with merge commits), the version bump (Cargo.toml / Cargo.lock).\n- Release gate (scripts/release.ps1: all debug suites, ui, clippy -D warnings, release --ignored heavy lanes for motion/sim/app): green - 0 failures. Zip built; no installer (ISCC not installed). Patch tag: pushed as a marker, no GitHub build (release.yml builds vX.Y.0 only).\n\nChangelog: none (release mechanics)",
